{
  "name": "NSC — Dispara Ofertas Aprovadas",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            { "field": "minutes", "minutesInterval": 30 }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Agenda (a cada 30min)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [-380, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "d1", "name": "baserow_url", "value": "https://baserow.arvsystems.cloud", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "d2", "name": "table_id", "value": "556", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "d3", "name": "baserow_token", "value": "<PREENCHER_BASEROW_TOKEN>", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "d4", "name": "waha_url", "value": "http://waha:3000", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "d5", "name": "waha_api_key", "value": "<PREENCHER_WAHA_API_KEY>", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "d6", "name": "waha_session", "value": "default", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "d7", "name": "group_id", "value": "120363410530925527@g.us", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-180, 0],
      "notes": "waha_url = http://waha:3000 -> rede interna (alias 'waha' na network_public). NAO usar o dominio publico pra falar com o vizinho de porta: gasta TLS e depende do Traefik. group_id no formato WAHA (120363...@g.us); o formato da Z-API (120363...-group) NAO funciona aqui."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('Config').item.json.baserow_url }}/api/database/rows/table/{{ $('Config').item.json.table_id }}/?user_field_names=true&size=200",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Token {{ $('Config').item.json.baserow_token }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Baserow: listar linhas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [20, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Portao de aprovacao. Aprovado = sai ja · Agendado = so quando scheduled_at venceu.\n// NUNCA dispara Fila. Sem photo_url/caption, pula (evita post quebrado no grupo).\n//\n// O n8n NAO monta legenda: le o `caption` pronto do Baserow e repassa cru.\n// Quem escreve o texto e a skill /agenda. Mudou o formato da mensagem? Nao mexe aqui.\nconst cfg = $('Config').first().json;\nconst now = new Date().toISOString();\nconst rows = ($input.first().json.results) || [];\nconst out = [];\nfor (const r of rows) {\n  const st = (r.status && r.status.value) ? r.status.value : r.status;\n  const due = st === 'Aprovado' || (st === 'Agendado' && r.scheduled_at && r.scheduled_at <= now);\n  if (!due) continue;\n  if (!r.photo_url || !r.caption) continue;\n  // Payload do WAHA montado aqui: o file.url e aninhado e nao cabe em body keypair.\n  // O WAHA busca a foto na URL publica do Baserow (o CDN do Mercari daria 403).\n  out.push({ json: {\n    row_id: r.id,\n    payload: {\n      session: cfg.waha_session,\n      chatId: cfg.group_id,\n      file: { url: r.photo_url },\n      caption: r.caption\n    }\n  }});\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Filtrar aprovados",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [220, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').item.json.waha_url }}/api/sendImage",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "X-Api-Key", "value": "={{ $('Config').item.json.waha_api_key }}" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.payload) }}",
        "options": { "timeout": 120000 }
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "WAHA: enviar oferta",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [420, 0],
      "notes": "Era Z-API (/send-image + header Client-Token). Agora WAHA: /api/sendImage + header X-Api-Key. O WAHA envia por um Chromium de verdade -> timeout de 120s. Com o padrao (5s) a requisicao estoura, a linha NAO vira Disparado, mas o post SAI mesmo assim = duplicata no proximo tick."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').item.json.baserow_url }}/api/database/rows/table/{{ $('Config').item.json.table_id }}/{{ $('Filtrar aprovados').item.json.row_id }}/?user_field_names=true",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Token {{ $('Config').item.json.baserow_token }}" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "keypair",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "status", "value": "Disparado" },
            { "name": "posted_at", "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}" },
            { "name": "wa_message_id", "value": "={{ $json.id && $json.id._serialized ? $json.id._serialized : $json.id }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Baserow: marcar Disparado",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [620, 0],
      "notes": "wa_message_id: a Z-API devolvia $json.messageId (string). O WAHA devolve `id`, que vem string OU objeto {_serialized}. A expressao cobre os dois."
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Agenda (a cada 30min)": { "main": [[{ "node": "Config", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Config": { "main": [[{ "node": "Baserow: listar linhas", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Baserow: listar linhas": { "main": [[{ "node": "Filtrar aprovados", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Filtrar aprovados": { "main": [[{ "node": "WAHA: enviar oferta", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "WAHA: enviar oferta": { "main": [[{ "node": "Baserow: marcar Disparado", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] }
  },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "pinData": {}
}
